# Wazuh agent daemon configuration (/etc/conf.d/<daemon>)
#
# The daemon binary is selected by the service name (RC_SVCNAME);
# per-daemon overrides belong here.  The daemons run as root (they
# must read system files for inventory - mirrored by the upstream
# design and the tthh430 confd's WA_USER="root").

# WAZUH_HOME="/var/ossec"
